  "description": "Lightweight resilience helpers (retry with jitter, circuit breaker) and response\n      handling for HttpClient with minimal dependencies.",
  "id": "Reliable.HttpClient",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-08-29T14:54:45.627Z",
